plemented directly thanks to your feedback!Here's what's changed:📖 Tutorials & Game MenuGame Menu Available in All Tutorials: You can now open the game menu during all three tutorials (Basics, Black City, and Combat) using the men","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T09:48:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694501","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4399300-1846651706681973","game_id":"steam-4399300","kind":"announcement","title":"BANDIT LIFE DEMO IS FINALLY OUT!","summary":"⚔️ BANDIT LIFE DEMO IS FINALLY OUT! 🔥The wait is over! Bandit Life Demo is now available to play for FREE on Steam! 🎉Hey everyone!After months of development, countless hours of coding, testing, balancing, and fixing bugs, I'm incredibly excited to finally share Bandit Life with you!As a solo developer, reaching this milestone means a lot to me. What started as a small personal project has slowly grown into something much bigger, and today, for the first time, you can experience it yourselves.🏕️","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T15:39:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681973","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4399300-1846651706673421","game_id":"steam-4399300","kind":"announcement","title":"⚔️ Bandit Life Demo Releases October 16! 🔥","summary":"⚔️ BANDIT LIFE DEMO RELEASE DATE ANNOUNCEMENT! 🔥Hey everyone!After months of development, countless hours of coding, testing, and fixing bugs, I'm finally ready to announce that Bandit Life Demo is coming to Steam this Friday, October 16th! 🎉This is a huge milestone for me. I've been working on Bandit Life as a solo developer, and seeing the game finally reach the point where I can share it with all of you is an incredible feeling.The demo will let you experience the beginning of your journey as","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T07:24:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706673421","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4399300-1846018067932371","game_id":"steam-4399300","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank you for 250 Wishlists!","summary":"Guys… WE DID IT! 250 wishlists on Steam! ❤️🔥Not so long ago, I was celebrating our first 100 wishlists. Now there's 250 of you waiting to start your own bandit journey!As a solo developer, seeing more and more people interested in something I'm building means the world to me.Thank you for every wishlist, comment, and bit of feedback. You guys are keeping this campfire burning! 🔥Next stop: 500. ⚔️See you by the fire! 🍻","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T07:05:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067932371","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4399300-1841579228667705","game_id":"steam-4399300","kind":"announcement","title":"100 Wishlists Reached!","summary":"100 WISHLISTS! ❤️Bandit Life has just reached its first 100 wishlists on Steam!For a solo developer working on his first game, this is a huge milestone.100 people looked at Bandit Life and thought:“Yeah, I want to keep an eye on this.”And that feels amazing.Thank you to everyone who wishlisted the game, followed the project, watched my videos, joined the Discord, tested builds, or shared feedback. Every bit of support helps more than you probably realize.The camp is still small, but it’s growing","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T06:52:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228667705","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4399300-1835236783567295","game_id":"steam-4399300","kind":"announcement","title":"The Woods Are Almost Ready: Bandit Life Demo Is Coming Soon","summary":"Hi everyone!I’m happy to announce that the demo version of Bandit Life is getting closer.The demo will give you a first proper look at the core experience of leading a band of outlaws, surviving in the woods, managing your camp, visiting Black City, and defending yourself when the king finally decides that your little forest business has gone far enough.There is no release date to share just yet, but the demo is already taking shape and will include: What will be available in the demo?Full in-ga","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-14T08:10:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783567295","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4399300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:27Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:27Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4399300":"2026-10-26T12:10:27Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4399300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:27Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:27Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:27Z"},"5294360":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:27Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:27Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:27Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4399300","app_id":4399300,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-1